right-click desktop & dock context menus, and the Floating Glassmorphic
Bottom Dock with 13 pinned Quantum & OS applications, #00E5FF active-window
indicator dots, live SIGUSR1/mtime wallpaper reload, and tracked after() timers.
=============================================================================
"""

